  "description": "<p>Black Ops 3 Camos including Single Player, Zombies, Multiplayer, Supply Drops and cut camos that I found while looking thru files. There are a few camos missing (I Will add When I can).  All the camos have been upscaled to look nice. From what I’ve seen they all look good in game. There’s a total of 191 camos. You can download the whole pack or I also have them separate on github.</p>\n<h3>CAMOS INCLUDED:</h3>\n<h4>Animal Skins 🐆</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Arapaima Scales</li>\n<li>Dragon Scales x3</li>\n<li>Fur x4</li>\n<li>Lizard Skin x2</li>\n<li>Piranha x3</li>\n<li>Scales</li>\n<li>Scarlet King</li>\n<li>Snake Skin</li>\n<li>Tiger Shark</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://imgur.com/a/animal-skin-n-fur-camos-EEJORGk\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://imgur.com/a/animal-skin-n-fur-camos-EEJORGk</a></p>\n<hr />\n<h4>Base Camos 🅱</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Single Player</li>\n<li>Zombies</li>\n<li>Multiplayer + Supply Drops</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://imgur.com/a/bo3-sp-zm-mp-camos-kYqpx2t\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://imgur.com/a/bo3-sp-zm-mp-camos-kYqpx2t</a><br />\n<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://imgur.com/a/bo3-supply-drop-camos-Nrb9TDl\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://imgur.com/a/bo3-supply-drop-camos-Nrb9TDl</a></p>\n<hr />\n<h4>Random Camouflage ❗</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Caterpillar</li>\n<li>Jungle x7</li>\n<li>Skywater x4</li>\n<li>Wild Dog x2</li>\n<li>WW3</li>\n<li>Cartel</li>\n<li>Combat Diver</li>\n<li>Soviet Winter Blue</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://imgur.com/a/random-camos-Cn9jnl2\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://imgur.com/a/random-camos-Cn9jnl2</a></p>\n<hr />\n<h4>Leather 🐎</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Brown</li>\n<li>Black</li>\n<li>Blued</li>\n<li>Croc</li>\n<li>Diamond</li>\n<li>White</li>\n<li>Worn</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://imgur.com/a/leather-camos-2CXf2bC\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://imgur.com/a/leather-camos-2CXf2bC</a></p>\n<hr />\n<h4>Fun Camos 🎨</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Biolum</li>\n<li>Ketchup</li>\n<li>Brains</li>\n<li>Camera Film</li>\n<li>Chrome Fairy</li>\n<li>Exterminator Eyes</li>\n<li>Frankenstein</li>\n<li>Ghost Blue</li>\n<li>Heatstroke Red</li>\n<li>Ice Ruin Frost</li>\n<li>Lightning x2</li>\n<li>Mummy</li>\n<li>Patricks</li>\n<li>Rubber</li>\n<li>Rubiks Cube x3</li>\n<li>Seaweed</li>\n<li>Solar</li>\n<li>Trippy</li>\n<li>Virus\n-Zulu</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://imgur.com/a/fun-camos-4sfU6Qx\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://imgur.com/a/fun-camos-4sfU6Qx</a></p>\n<hr />\n<h4>Patterns 🪩</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>80s Flash</li>\n<li>Anhanga</li>\n<li>Ornate</li>\n<li>Blackblood</li>\n<li>Haida</li>\n<li>Poseidon x3</li>\n<li>Samurai x2</li>\n<li>Boxes</li>\n<li>Bugeyes</li>\n<li>Geist</li>\n<li>Harley Quinn</li>\n<li>Hexagon Bee</li>\n<li>Jester</li>\n<li>Kabuki</li>\n<li>Multiball</li>\n<li>Night Sky</li>\n<li>Ninja</li>\n<li>Ocean x2</li>\n<li>Phoenix</li>\n<li>Terracotta Armor</li>\n<li>Tokusatsu Blue</li>\n<li>Torque</li>\n<li>Vampire</li>\n<li>Yellowjacket</li>\n<li>Ziptie</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://imgur.com/a/pattern-camos-LeErZQS\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://imgur.com/a/pattern-camos-LeErZQS</a></p>\n<hr />\n<h4>Gems N Rocks 🪨</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Bling Diamond</li>\n<li>Jade x2</li>\n<li>Ember x2</li>\n<li>Pearl</li>\n<li>Ruby</li>\n<li>White Marble</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://imgur.com/a/gem-n-rock-camos-p9LXuw7\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://imgur.com/a/gem-n-rock-camos-p9LXuw7</a></p>\n<hr />\n<h4>Wood 🪵</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Wood x3</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://imgur.com/a/wood-camos-FhkeyZi\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://imgur.com/a/wood-camos-FhkeyZi</a></p>\n<hr />\n<h4>Met